  "body": "What changed:\n- `crates/app/tests/sinumerik_810m_post.rs` has a new `Gate map:` doc line. Nothing else changed.\n- The line names `camcraft_post::post` (`sinumerik-810m.cps`), `app::posting`, `app::project` and `app::commands`. It names no moved module as `app::<module>`.\n\nReadings:\n- Before: `gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app` failed with `suites without a Gate map: [\"sinumerik_810m_post\"]`.\n- After: `cargo test -j 6 -p xtask gate_maps -- --test-threads=6` passes (20 passed, 0 failed).\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main --dry-run` prints a plan with the step `app suites: sinumerik_810m_post`.\n\nPinned by: `gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app`.\n\nNot exercised: the `sinumerik_810m_post` app test binary. `camcraft-app` does not compile on main now (#3717, fix in PR #3715). This PR changes only a doc comment.\n\nEffort: low\nChangelog: none\nFixes #3719\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
